+# Starlight Swarm Operator Pack License Terms
+
+Version: 0.1.0
+
+This package is sold as a software access license for operator tooling, installable skills, and runtime doctrine. It is not an investment contract, revenue participation instrument, security, passive-income promise, or fund-management product.
+
+## Buyer Rights
+
+- Install and use the packaged runtime and skills for internal agent orchestration.
+- Adapt the package for the buyer's own private workflows.
+- Verify the package against the included manifest, source commit, and package hash.
+
+## Restrictions
+
+- Do not resell the package as a competing marketplace item without a separate reseller agreement.
+- Do not claim token ownership grants revenue share, equity, voting rights, or guaranteed income.
+- Do not remove attribution, safety gates, or fail-closed payment language.
+- Do not wire the payment-governance adapters to live funds without independent review and explicit human approval.
+
+## Safety Boundary
+
+Agents may draft, verify, package, and gate. Humans approve capital, irreversible actions, production deployments, mainnet releases, and live fund movement.
+
+## No Private Context
+
+This pack intentionally excludes private Starlight memory, credentials, local machine configuration, unreleased client work, and internal strategy not needed to operate the public runtime.
